# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan Revision Update Improvements<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As a sustainable fashion enthusiast, I am committed to exploring innovative methods for reducing waste in the fashion industry. This design doc outlines potential opportunities for upcycling and repurposing in the fashion industry.<br>
<br>
## Upcycling Methods<br>
<br>
1. Textile reuse: Utilize existing textiles by repurposing them into new products.<br>
2. Recycling of fabric scraps: Transform fabric scraps into usable materials for crafting or sewing.<br>
3. Creative ways to repurpose old garments:<br>
	* Turn old t-shirts into reusable bags or cleaning rags<br>
	* Upcycle jeans into unique handbags or pouches<br>
```<br>
